Exponents of n (fixed L, delta):
   c(E*+1)/n                       : 4*alpha - 1   negative iff alpha < 1/4
   grid term                       : alpha - 1/2   negative iff alpha < 1/2
   Hoeffding g-term                : 4*alpha - 1/2   negative iff alpha < 1/8
   Bernstein g-term (linear part)  : 2*alpha - 1/2   negative iff alpha < 1/4
   Bernstein g-term (range part)   : 4*alpha - 1   negative iff alpha < 1/4
Displayed bound (Hoeffding): max exponent = 4*alpha - 1/2 -> polynomially small iff alpha < 1/8
Repaired bound (Bernstein):  max exponent = Max(2*alpha - 1/2, 4*alpha - 1) -> polynomially small iff alpha < 1/4
